sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant RW as Reconciliation (Order Service)
    participant PGO as PostgreSQL (order_service)
    participant MQ as RabbitMQ
    participant IS as Inventory Service
    participant R as Redis
    Note over MQ: the StockReserved result was dead-lettered and the DLQ purged
    RW->>PGO: find orders stuck in PendingStock past the timeout
    RW->>PGO: insert a new OrderPlaced Outbox row (new MessageId)
    MQ->>IS: deliver the re-triggered OrderPlaced
    IS->>R: EVAL reserve.lua
    R-->>IS: DUPLICATE (no second deduction)
    IS->>MQ: re-send the stored StockReserved (original MessageId)
    MQ->>PGO: Order Service applies it: Confirmed, then Completed
    Note over RW: after 3 re-triggers without progress: one Error alert, the order stays PendingStock
